    "traits": {
      "value": [
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Hallowed Strikes"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "[Initial] Your eidolon's attacks are hallowed by the celestial realms. Your eidolon's unarmed Strikes deal an extra 1 good damage; as usual, this extra damage harms only evil creatures or those with a weakness to good damage. Additionally, your eidolon can make nonlethal attacks with its unarmed attacks without taking the usual \u22122 circumstance penalty."
            },
            "id": "53709520-f499-4b42-811c-47440eed0db5",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-18T13:49:43.704115"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Traveler's Aura"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "[Symbiosis] Your eidolon emanates a powerful aura\u2014resembling that of an astral deva\u2014that protects creatures as they travel. The aura has the abjuration, aura, and divine traits. Your eidolon and its allies within a 20-foot emanation are protected from severe heat and cold, and your eidolon is never flat-footed to creatures inside the aura that are of a lower level than the eidolon.\n\nWhen you gain the transcendence class feature, this evolves to the full benefits of an astral deva; your eidolon and allies in the aura are protected from environmental damage from any plane, including severe and extreme heat and cold as well as more unusual dangers."
            },
            "id": "ff0deb4b-0948-4541-88aa-50bb8ebd3623",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-18T13:49:43.704115"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Angelic Mercy"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "[Transcendence] Your eidolon's angelic power allows them to assuage a variety of ailments, just like most other powerful angels. Your eidolon can cast remove curse, remove disease, remove fear, and remove paralysis once per day each as 9th-level divine innate spells."
            },
            "id": "577cde23-9888-4ef6-b4bb-bcd2fd014066",
            "updated_at": {
